  /// completions adapter sends `<authHeader>: <apiKey>` INSTEAD of the
  /// default `Authorization: Bearer <apiKey>` — an AWS API Gateway fronting
  /// Bedrock rejects Bearer and requires `x-api-key`. Null keeps the Bearer
