/// gh-1742 review round 1, comment 6: the caller's model rides the
/// StreamFunction contract — when it is the SAME identity as the entry
/// (provider/modelId/baseUrl) but carries a different context window,
/// the caller's window wins (registry truth over the stale catalog
/// value); a different identity keeps the entry's own model.
Model _dialModel(Model entryModel, Model? requested) {
 if (requested == null) return entryModel;
 if (ModelWindowKey.of(entryModel) != ModelWindowKey.of(requested)) {
