The fix — rewrite the AC-R3 test to derive the seed from the meter (the file's header rule). Design:

```dart
test('AC-R3 wiring: ...', () async {
 // The DEFAULT budget keeps the whole seeded file; the PIN overrides
 // it with a LARGER reserve — the budget must shrink accordingly,
 // proving the wiring reads the ACTIVE settings and never the curve.
 // The seed count derives from the file's own meter (this header's
